     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">A paper titled,  Draft SDG Planning Guidelines was produced
Core Teams for the targeted pilot Ministries for the Project Roll Out was undertaken 
The Roll Our Project was kickstarted in 2 out of the 6 target Ministries. 2 of the 5 Stages of the Guidelines were achieved
The Project Officer was hired, however the Project Manage resigned
The SDG Implementation Status Report for Botswana was finalised and procurement for printing done</narrative>
      </comment>
